# Python bytecode and the PLY parser tables, both regenerated by any build of
# the ISA description. They were committed to this repository, so a rebuild
# left them modified and a "git add -A" swept 386 of them into a commit whose
# own content was six files. Ignoring them keeps that from happening again.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
parsetab.py

# SCons build output.
/build/
